#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:287
#, no-c-format
msgid "Frequently asked questions"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Who made this game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"The kdegames team. You can find their website <ulink url=\"http://games.kde."
"org\">here</ulink>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:296
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where can I get cheatcodes?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:297
#, no-c-format
msgid "You cannot get cheatcodes for &kde; games."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:300
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I start a new game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:301
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To start a new game use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul"
"\">&Ctrl;<keycap>N</keycap></keycombo></shortcut><guimenu>Game</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>New</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on the menubar or click "
"the <guibutton>New</guibutton> button on the toolbar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:304
#, no-c-format
msgid "How do I pause the game?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:305
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have a 'Pause' feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:308
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the way this game looks. Can I?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:309
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Sudoku games are traditionally played using square grid. Themes would not "
"make much sense here. However, you can select the set of symbols used in "
"game. To do so use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on "
"menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:312
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I changed the symbols in the configuration dialog and now my entire game "
"board is filled with question marks. What is the problem?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:313 index.docbook:388
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Each set contains a limited number of possible symbols. If you have chosen "
"the set which has less symbols then your current game requires, the "
"application will complain by displaying question marks. Change the set to "
"fix the problem."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:316
#, no-c-format
msgid "I have made a mistake. Can I undo?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:317
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To undo use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycombo action=\"simul\">&Ctrl;"
"<keycap>Z</keycap></keycombo></shortcut><guimenu>Move</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Undo</guimenuitem></menuchoice>."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:320
#, no-c-format
msgid "Can I use keyboard?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:321
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. In &kappname; keyboard play is always enabled. Please use cursor keys "
"to move the selection, numeric characters to enter the symbols and &Shift; "
"key to apply markers."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:324
#, no-c-format
msgid "I cannot figure out what to do here! Are there hints?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:325
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To access 'Hint' feature use <menuchoice><shortcut><keycap>H</keycap></"
"shortcut><guimenu>Move</guimenu><guimenuitem>Hint</guimenuitem></menuchoice> "
"on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:328
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"I have to quit the game now, but I am not finished yet. Can I save my "
"progress?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:329
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Yes. To access 'Save' feature use <menuchoice> <shortcut><keycombo action="
"\"simul\">&Ctrl;<keycap>S</keycap></keycombo></shortcut> <guimenu>Game</"
"guimenu> <guimenuitem>Save</guimenuitem> </menuchoice> on the menubar."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:336
#, no-c-format
msgid "Where are the high scores?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:337
#, no-c-format
msgid "&kappname; does not have this feature."
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:340
#, no-c-format
msgid "I want to change the game configuration. Where do I go?"
msgstr ""

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:341
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To access the game settings use <menuchoice><guimenu>Settings</"
"guimenu><guimenuitem>Configure &kappname;...</guimenuitem></menuchoice> on "
"the menubar. See the <link linkend=\"configuration\">Game Configuration</"
"link> section for details."
msgstr ""

